			(property "Description" "SparkFun LoRa 1W Breakout 915MHz (SPX-18572): EBYTE E19-915M30S (Semtech SX1276 + 1W PA/LNA). 5V powers the module; 3V3 only feeds the on-board 100k pull-ups on ~CS and ~RST (logic is 3.3V). TXEN/RXEN drive the RF switch (100k pull-downs on board). SDI = MCU MOSI, SDO = MCU MISO. D0-D5 = SX1276 DIO0-DIO5."
				(at 0 -10.16 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
